# FirstPass's shared packages (@firstpass/playhq) come from GitHub Packages, where they're published under the
# repository owner's name. package.json installs them under @firstpass/* with an npm alias. Installing needs a
# token that can read packages: in ~/.npmrc on a Mac (//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=...), from setup-node in CI.
@zapheus-runplaywin:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
